WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — The Last Message — Episode 1 — English subtitles (PRIMARY dialogue, language: en)

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
It's two in the morning… who messages now?

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
A voice message… from my mother?

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Layla, my love… if you're hearing this, then I'm gone.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
I recorded this message a year before I left.

5
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Don't be afraid… I'm still with you.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Impossible… my mother died a year ago.

7
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Omar, listen… that's Mama's voice, isn't it?

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
It really is her voice… but this can't be happening.

9
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:44.000
The message sent itself… scheduled a year ago.

10
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Go back to the old house, Layla… before it's sold.

11
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
The house was sold two months ago… how does she know?

12
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
There's something waiting for you there… under the stairs.

13
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:08.000
If you heard this message… don't be late.

14
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:16.000
A new message arrived… from the same number.

15
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Layla… I'm still here.
